  <key>PayloadDescription</key><string>Installs the Knockout Isles app icon (a full-screen shortcut to the game by Ninebolt Studios). Remove it any time in Settings → General → VPN &amp; Device Management.</string>
  <key>PayloadDisplayName</key><string>Knockout Isles</string>
